OL,3,GNEWSAIndependent bicycle firm ceases
OL,4,Atrading after 34 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sports firm which specialises in
OL,7,Felectric bicycles has suddenly ceased
OL,8,Ftrading after 34 years.
OL,10,FCustomers found shutters closed at
OL,11,FPrimera Sports in Charminster Road,
OL,12,FBournemouth, on Friday, according to
OL,13,Fsocial media.
OL,15,FThe business said it had instructed
OL,16,Finsolvency firm Leonard Curtis, which
OL,17,Fthe BBC has approached for comment.
OL,19,FOne customer told the BBC he paid a
OL,20,F#6,000 balance on 14 August for two
OL,21,Fe-bikes which never arrived.
